  "id": "coconut-fish-curry-with-rice",
  "name": "Coconut Fish Curry with Rice",
  "subtitle": "A quick coconut curry with fish and tender squash.",
  "description": "Marinate the fish briefly with lime and spices, then simmer it with aromatics, vegetables, coconut milk, and tamarind. Serve with cooked rice and fresh herbs.",
